304
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:17,000
Yes.

305
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:19,039
The one from Xiaoxiao Deyue Restaurant in Suzhou?

306
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:20,559
Squirrel Fish.

307
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,000
Tell me how you make it.

308
00:17:22,319 --> 00:17:24,200
I want to hear the detailed recipe.

309
00:17:25,440 --> 00:17:26,119
Right.

310
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:29,599
Squirrel Fish is a famous Jiangsu dish.

311
00:17:30,240 --> 00:17:32,680
First, you need to prepare a fish,

312
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,279
about 750 grams.

313
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:35,920
Preferably a mandarin fish.

314
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:38,079
Then 18 grams of peeled shrimp.

315
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,960
15 green peas.

316
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,839
1,000 grams of refined lard.

317
00:17:41,920 --> 00:17:42,960
And then...

318
00:17:44,759 --> 00:17:45,839
Mr. Fang?

319
00:17:47,079 --> 00:17:48,119
Mr. Fang?

320
00:17:48,319 --> 00:17:49,119
Mr. Fang...

321
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:52,440
Mr. Fang!

322
00:17:53,079 --> 00:17:54,319
There you are!

323
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:56,480
I thought you ran away.

324
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,119
I'm not running.

325
00:17:58,279 --> 00:18:01,319
A man should come into this world clean,

326
00:18:02,359 --> 00:18:03,200
and when he leaves...

327
00:18:03,839 --> 00:18:05,119
Well, he doesn't necessarily have to leave, right?

328
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,480
Through interacting with you all day,

329
00:18:10,519 --> 00:18:11,839
I really feel much better.

330
00:18:13,119 --> 00:18:14,119
Really?

331
00:18:15,480 --> 00:18:16,079
Unlock me.

332
00:18:16,079 --> 00:18:17,119
Let's go get a body scrub.

333
00:18:18,720 --> 00:18:19,920
I can't unlock it.

334
00:18:20,039 --> 00:18:21,799
You'll run away if I do.

335
00:18:21,799 --> 00:18:22,880
Why would I run?

336
00:18:23,079 --> 00:18:23,839
I, uh...

337
00:18:24,440 --> 00:18:25,680
Isn't the wristband with you?

338
00:18:26,400 --> 00:18:27,160
How could I... I don't have clothes.

339
00:18:27,160 --> 00:18:28,240
How could I run out of here?

340
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:29,359
I'd be breaking the law!

341
00:18:29,799 --> 00:18:31,359
Tell me how I could run away.

342
00:18:31,599 --> 00:18:32,519
Treat me like your older brother.

343
00:18:32,519 --> 00:18:33,400
Tell me how I could run away.

344
00:18:33,640 --> 00:18:35,160
Come on. Name one way.

345
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:39,039
Seems like you can't run.

346
00:18:39,039 --> 00:18:39,759
Right.

347
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:41,240
Then I'll untie you.

348
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:42,880
You can't run.

349
00:18:42,880 --> 00:18:43,640
I won't. I won't.

350
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:44,640
Untie me.

351
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:50,039
Bro,

352
00:18:51,640 --> 00:18:53,000
you just mentioned some of

353
00:18:53,160 --> 00:18:54,240
