354
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:56,440
So how exactly do you make Squirrel Fish?

355
00:18:56,440 --> 00:18:57,920
Could you explain it in more detail?

356
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:58,480
Bro?

357
00:18:59,440 --> 00:19:02,000
Then, after killing the mandarin fish,

358
00:19:02,000 --> 00:19:03,559
descale and gut it.

359
00:19:03,599 --> 00:19:05,200
And after washing it clean,

360
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,920
lay it flat on the cutting board.

361
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:08,440
First, chop off the fish head.

362
00:19:08,559 --> 00:19:10,720
Make a cut at the top of the head.

363
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:12,519
Put the fish head aside.

364
00:19:13,039 --> 00:19:13,960
Are you the attendant?

365
00:19:14,039 --> 00:19:15,160
Come help me open a locker.

366
00:19:16,640 --> 00:19:17,160
102.

367
00:19:17,519 --> 00:19:18,279
Come on! Come here!

368
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:19,279
What's wrong?

369
00:19:20,119 --> 00:19:21,640
Open the locker. I need my clothes.

370
00:19:21,640 --> 00:19:22,400
Where's your wristband?

371
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:22,960
I...

372
00:19:23,839 --> 00:19:25,400
By the way, Mr. Fang,

373
00:19:25,599 --> 00:19:29,759
do you prefer sweet or savory?

374
00:19:33,839 --> 00:19:35,359
Mr. Fang?

375
00:19:38,480 --> 00:19:39,759
I took a dive and lost my wristband.

376
00:19:39,839 --> 00:19:42,359
Hurry. My phone is inside.

377
00:19:42,359 --> 00:19:43,960
I can't pay without it. Hurry!

378
00:19:45,319 --> 00:19:46,039
Get lost!

379
00:19:47,880 --> 00:19:49,839
You went to the bathroom without closing the door!

380
00:19:58,599 --> 00:20:00,599
Mr. Fang?

381
00:20:04,440 --> 00:20:05,720
Mr. Fang!

382
00:20:18,359 --> 00:20:19,400
Why are you looking at my face?

383
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:22,720
I can't recognize you by your ass.

384
00:20:26,039 --> 00:20:27,480
Mr. Fang!

385
00:20:28,839 --> 00:20:30,079
Attendant!

386
00:20:30,839 --> 00:20:31,960
Attendant!

387
00:20:32,160 --> 00:20:32,799
What is it?

388
00:20:32,960 --> 00:20:33,960
Did you see

389
00:20:33,960 --> 00:20:36,240
