390
00:20:36,240 --> 00:20:37,279
The one who crapped his pants?

391
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:38,200
He left.

392
00:20:42,039 --> 00:20:42,839
Without a key,

393
00:20:42,839 --> 00:20:44,599
